Search motor.fusionspace.co's motors, with who has them in stock and at what price

Usage: hpr motors search [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --in-stock
          Only motors in stock at one vendor or more

      --json
          Print one JSON document on standard output instead of text; errors too

      --class <CLASS>
          Only this impulse class, such as L

      --color <WHEN>
          When to use color. Auto colors what goes to a terminal and heeds NO_COLOR, FORCE_COLOR and CLICOLOR_FORCE. JSON output never has color
          
          [default: auto]
          [possible values: auto, always, never]

      --diameter <MM>
          Only this diameter, mm (within 0.5 mm)

      --manufacturer <MANUFACTURER>
          Only this manufacturer: AeroTech, Cesaroni or Loki, or its full name, in any case

      --max-price <DOLLARS>
          Only motors in stock whose price for one motor, at the cheapest vendor, is at most this many U.S. dollars, such as 150 or 149.99

      --from <FILE>
          Read a list saved earlier, motor.fusionspace.co's motors.json or in-stock.json, instead of fetching it

      --offline
          Answer from the cache only, never the network

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

Examples:
  Find an L motor in stock:
      hpr motors search --class L --in-stock
  Find 54 mm motors in stock for at most $150:
      hpr motors search --diameter 54 --in-stock --max-price 150

Guide: https://hpr.fusionspace.co/cli.html#motors-you-can-buy
